ORG=[
 ('Cell wall','fence and brick walls','Gives shape, support and protection.','A strong cellulose layer outside the membrane.','cell wall'),
 ('Cell membrane','farm gate','Controls movement into and out of the cell.','A thin, selectively permeable boundary inside the wall.','cell membrane'),
 ('Nucleus','farm office','Contains DNA: instructions used by the cell.','The nuclear envelope encloses the DNA.','nucleus'),
 ('Chloroplast','solar panels','Uses light energy to make glucose in photosynthesis.','Internal membranes contain chlorophyll that absorbs light.','chloroplast'),
 ('Large central vacuole','water storage tank','Stores cell sap and helps maintain turgor.','A large fluid-filled compartment; pressure helps support the cell.','vacuole'),
 ('Mitochondrion','generator','Releases usable energy through aerobic respiration.','Its folded inner membrane provides surface area for this process.','mitochondrion'),
 ('Rough ER','delivery roads + loading bays','Helps process and transport proteins made on its ribosomes.','A membrane network with ribosomes attached.','rough ER'),
 ('Ribosomes','farm workers','Build proteins using genetic instructions.','Small structures, free in the cytoplasm or attached to rough ER.','ribosomes'),
 ('Golgi apparatus','packing and dispatch depot','Modifies, sorts and packages proteins and lipids.','Stacks of membrane sacs and transport vesicles.','Golgi apparatus')]

